---
title: "_vestingSchedule (LegionLinearEpochVesting)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_checkTime: timestamp < start?
    q_checkTime --> q_zero: timestamp < start - return 0
    q_checkTime --> q_calcEpoch: currentEpoch = (timestamp - start) / epochDuration
    q_calcEpoch --> q_capEpoch: epoch = min(currentEpoch, numberOfEpochs)
    q_capEpoch --> q_calcVested: amountVested = totalAllocation * epoch / numberOfEpochs
    q_calcVested --> q_checkFull: timestamp >= start + duration?
    q_checkFull --> q_returnFull: return totalAllocation
    q_checkFull --> q_returnPartial: return amountVested
    q_zero --> [*]: return 0
    q_returnFull --> [*]: return totalAllocation
    q_returnPartial --> [*]: return amountVested

    note right of q_calcEpoch
        INV-001: Vesting is stepwise - unlocks at epoch boundaries
        INV-002: epoch = floor((timestamp - start) / epochDuration)
    end note

    note right of q_calcVested
        INV-003: amountVested = totalAllocation * completedEpochs / totalEpochs
        INV-004: Integer division may cause dust amounts to be locked until final epoch
    end note
